| `Stop hook` | Runs the doc review when an agent session stops, through `.claude/settings.json` and the neutral `scripts/project_python.py` launcher, which selects the current worktree's `.venv/bin/python` before the main checkout's. | automatic | — | Missing venvs refuse with USAGE (2), naming both paths and the build remedy. Fallback requires a non-bare common directory ending in `.git`; unusual layouts refuse rather than guess. Arguments, stdin and the script's status pass through. Vendor wiring: one agent tool's hook format. It reviews; it does not apply edits. Not for choosing where long jobs run: `scripts/launch.py` does. | [doc-style.md](../guides/doc-style.md) | always |
